{"id":325285,"bangumiId":325285,"type":2,"name":"オッドタクシー","name_cn":"奇巧计程车","date":"2021-04-05","year":"2021","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/65/90/325285_4688X.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/65/90/325285_4688X.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/65/90/325285_4688X.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/65/90/325285_4688X.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/65/90/325285_4688X.jpg"},"summary":"明明是熟悉的街道，这座城市却似乎有哪里变得不太一样了。\r\n出租车司机小户川每天平凡度日。他没有亲人，鲜少与人交流，是个有点孤僻木讷的怪人。兴趣是在睡前听落语和工作时听广播。姑且能称得上是他朋友的人，只有他的主治医生刚力，以及高中同学柿花而已。\r\n他载到的尽是些有点古怪的客人：一心想在网路上被疯传的大学生，桦泽；似乎有所隐情的护理师，白川；不太红的搞笑二人组，智人拍档；街头无赖，阴沟；正要开始走红的偶像女团，神秘之吻等。\r\n人与人之间百无聊赖的对话，最后竟与一位失踪少女扯上了关系。","rating":{"rank":41,"total":22378,"count":{"1":32,"2":17,"3":20,"4":29,"5":100,"6":419,"7":1880,"8":7403,"9":9552,"10":2926},"score":8.5},"collection":{"on_hold":878,"dropped":246,"wish":7480,"collect":33846,"doing":1903},"tags":[{"name":"原创","count":6323,"total_count":639673},{"name":"悬疑","count":6174,"total_count":117522},{"name":"群像","count":4327,"total_count":13262},{"name":"2021年4月","count":2700,"total_count":26035},{"name":"TV","count":2364,"total_count":1454980},{"name":"推理","count":2333,"total_count":75920},{"name":"剧情","count":2292,"total_count":16541},{"name":"P.I.C.S.","count":1788,"total_count":1899},{"name":"动物","count":1704,"total_count":6318},{"name":"2021","count":1347,"total_count":80753},{"name":"OLM","count":789,"total_count":13204},{"name":"木下麦","count":549,"total_count":688},{"name":"神作","count":406,"total_count":48629},{"name":"日本","count":379,"total_count":319594},{"name":"此元和津也","count":335,"total_count":418},{"name":"日本动画","count":153,"total_count":36249},{"name":"木村良平","count":56,"total_count":3011},{"name":"2021年","count":50,"total_count":3721},{"name":"奇巧计程车","count":38,"total_count":46},{"name":"都市","count":38,"total_count":792},{"name":"奇幻","count":33,"total_count":496697},{"name":"日常","co